## Proposed Changes

### 1. Configuration & Security (Backend)

We will modify the Google Apps Script to verify every request against Google's token servers.

#### [MODIFY] [Config.gs](file:///c:/Users/azama/M%20Versa/tabung-tracker/gas/Config.gs)
- Add `AUTHORIZED_EMAILS` array.
- Add `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID = '310780157680-foa39tk01sdtmchhq1t93vu3av3i28p0.apps.googleusercontent.com'`.

#### [MODIFY] [Router.gs](file:///c:/Users/azama/M%20Versa/tabung-tracker/gas/Router.gs)
- **New Function**: `verifyToken(idToken)` - Uses `UrlFetchApp` to call Google's `tokeninfo` endpoint.
- **Lockdown**: Update `doGet` and `doPost` to call `verifyToken` first. Access is denied unless the token is valid AND the user's email is in the whitelist.

